{{// 🔞 Chibi Adult Context: unlocks mature stories, in about 68 tokens where the full edition spends 116. Sex, violence and dark themes are written frankly, with characters who stay themselves the whole way through, so a shy character is still shy in bed: dark scenes run morally grey to black, consent is never re-asked in reciprocal acts, sex gets autonomic and auditory feedback, violence is visceral and medically exact, speech uses vulgar slang while narration uses plain anatomy words, each plea or tease is new, and persona and Slow Burn set the pace. Chibi shortened the scope from sexual, violent, cruel or dark scenes to dark scenes, and dropped 'drawn from this beat's contact and rhythm' and 'forwardness shows in acts'. Only switch it on if you're an adult and want that kind of story. It also tells The Logic Core which mode it's in.}}{{trim}}
{{setvar::ariaModeLine::- Mode: realism, persona-true; each plea new.}}{{trim}}
Adult fiction. Dark scenes: morality grey to black; reciprocal consent never re-asked. Sex: frank, granular; autonomic and auditory feedback. Violence: visceral, medically exact. Speech: vulgar slang; narration: plain anatomy. Each plea new; persona and Slow Burn set pace.

